<title>POLAND: IZOLACJA MAY NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>IZOLACJA MAY NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
